 "content": {
  "rendered": "<section class=\"bde-section-1303-100 bde-section\">\n              \n  \n  \n\t\n\n  <div class=\"section-background-overlay\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"section-container\"><div class=\"bde-columns-1303-101 bde-columns\"><div class=\"bde-column-1303-102 bde-column\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"bde-heading-1303-103 bde-heading\">\nTry Our Free AI Hair Assessment Report & Cost Calculator\n</h1><div class=\"bde-text-1303-104 bde-text\">\nWe use artificial intelligence to calculate the approximate cost of hair transplantation.\n</div><div class=\"bde-button-1303-108 bde-button\">\n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n            \n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-atom button-atom--primary bde-button__button\"  >\n    \n        <span class=\"button-atom__text\">Get Your Free Hair Report</span>\n\n        \n        \n            </button>\n    \n\n\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"bde-column-1303-106 bde-column\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bde-image2-1303-107 bde-image2\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/AI-Hair-Analysis-Report.png\" alt=\"Ai hair analysis report\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/AI-Hair-Analysis-Report.png 650w, https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/AI-Hair-Analysis-Report-300x208.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\">\n</div></div></div>\n</section><section class=\"bde-section-1303-109 bde-section\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"section-container\"><div class=\"bde-text-1303-110 bde-text\">\nWe use the latest AI image recognition technology to assess your current hair condition, providing you with the information you need.\n</div></div>\n</section><section class=\"bde-section-1303-132 bde-section\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"section-container\"><h2 class=\"bde-heading-1303-133 bde-heading\">\nHow Does It Work?\n</h2><div class=\"bde-text-1303-134 bde-text\">\n<b>Complete the assessment in 3 easy steps!</b>\n</div><div class=\"bde-grid-1303-135 bde-grid\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-div-1303-136 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bde-image2-1303-138 bde-image2\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/noun-mobile-camera-3730166-FFFFFF.svg\" alt=\"mobile camera\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\"><h4 class=\"bde-heading-1303-139 bde-heading\">\nTake A Photo\n</h4><div class=\"bde-text-1303-140 bde-text\">\nTake a high-resolution photo of your scalp in good light and upload it. Focus on the area you want to analyze with our tool. High-quality images are essential for accurate analysis. We recommend using your smartphone's camera.\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"bde-div-1303-141 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bde-image2-1303-142 bde-image2\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/noun-ai-8035527-FFFFFF.svg\" alt=\"AI Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\"><h4 class=\"bde-heading-1303-143 bde-heading\">\nWait for the AI to analyze your images!\n</h4><div class=\"bde-text-1303-144 bde-text\">\nLet the artificial intelligence analyze your hair condition using a database of over 15,000 images. Al will examine your photos, identify your hair condition, and accurately determine your current stage of hair loss.\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"bde-div-1303-145 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bde-image2-1303-146 bde-image2\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/noun-download-document-5269784-FFFFFF.svg\" alt=\"download document icon\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\"><h4 class=\"bde-heading-1303-147 bde-heading\">\nGet Your Report\n</h4><div class=\"bde-text-1303-148 bde-text\">\nGet a detailed report describing the possible causes of your hair loss and the solutions that are proven to be the most effective based on current research. It also provides a estimate of numbers of graft and the cost of hair transplant.\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"bde-button-1303-149 bde-button\">\n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n            \n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-atom button-atom--primary bde-button__button\"  >\n    \n        <span class=\"button-atom__text\">Get Your Free Hair Report</span>\n\n        \n        \n            </button>\n    \n\n\n</div></div>\n</section><section class=\"bde-section-1303-150 bde-section\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"section-container\"><h2 class=\"bde-heading-1303-151 bde-heading\">\nYour Trusted Hair Transplant Surgeon in Bangalore\n</h2><div class=\"bde-text-1303-152 bde-text\">\nExpertise. Experience. Excellence. Dr. Sandeep Mahapatra brings it all to every hair restoration journey.\n</div><div class=\"bde-columns-1303-153 bde-columns\"><div class=\"bde-column-1303-154 bde-column\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bde-image2-1303-155 bde-image2\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dr-Sandeep-Mahapatra-3.jpg\" alt=\"Dr Sandeep Mahapatra\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dr-Sandeep-Mahapatra-3.jpg 650w, https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dr-Sandeep-Mahapatra-3-300x208.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\"><h3 class=\"bde-heading-1303-156 bde-heading\">\nDr Sandeep Mahapatra\n</h3><h5 class=\"bde-heading-1303-157 bde-heading\">\nSenior Consultant Dermatologist, Cosmetic Expert & Hair Transplant Surgeon\n</h5><h5 class=\"bde-heading-1303-158 bde-heading\">\nFounder, Neo Follicle Transplant Clinic in Marathahalli, Whitefield - Bangalore\n</h5>\n</div><div class=\"bde-column-1303-159 bde-column\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-grid-1303-160 bde-grid\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-image-box-1303-161 bde-image-box\">\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-image\">\n  <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/noun-experience-7640630-FFF2F2.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-content\">\n      <h4 class=\"ee-imagebox-title bde-h3\" >20+ Years of Experience</h4>\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n</div><div class=\"bde-image-box-1303-162 bde-image-box\">\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-image\">\n  <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/noun-head-4996456-FFF2F2.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-content\">\n      <h4 class=\"ee-imagebox-title bde-h3\" >10000+ Hair Transplants Performed</h4>\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n</div><div class=\"bde-image-box-1303-163 bde-image-box\">\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-image\">\n  <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/noun-international-7293964-FFF2F2.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" alt=\"International Patients for Hair Transplant icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-content\">\n      <h4 class=\"ee-imagebox-title bde-h3\" >500+ International Patients</h4>\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n</div><div class=\"bde-image-box-1303-164 bde-image-box\">\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-image\">\n  <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/noun-hair-transplant-7103592-FFF2F2.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" alt=\"Hair Follicles icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-content\">\n      <h4 class=\"ee-imagebox-title bde-h3\" >6,000,000+ Hair Follicles Transplanted</h4>\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n</div><div class=\"bde-image-box-1303-165 bde-image-box\">\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-image\">\n  <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/noun-laboratory-4349385-FFF2F2.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" alt=\"PRP - Plasma Rich Platelet icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-content\">\n      <h4 class=\"ee-imagebox-title bde-h3\" >100,000+ PRP Sessions Completed</h4>\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n</div><div class=\"bde-image-box-1303-166 bde-image-box\">\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-image\">\n  <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/noun-doctor-4409388-FFF2F2.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" alt=\"Hair Transplant Surgeon Icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-content\">\n      <h4 class=\"ee-imagebox-title bde-h3\" >18+ Hair Transplant Surgeons Trained</h4>\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n</div><div class=\"bde-image-box-1303-167 bde-image-box\">\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-image\">\n  <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/noun-healthcare-assistant-4134746-FFF2F2.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" alt=\"Healthcare assistant icon\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"ee-imagebox-content\">\n      <h4 class=\"ee-imagebox-title bde-h3\" >55+ Skilled Assistants Trained</h4>\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n</div><div class=\"bde-div-1303-168 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<a class=\"bde-text-link-1303-169 bde-text-link breakdance-link\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" data-type=\"url\">\n  Click Here to Learn More Abour Dr Sandeep Mahapatra\n\n</a>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"bde-grid-1303-170 bde-grid\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bde-image2-1303-171 bde-image2\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Three-Best-Rated-Logo.jpg\" alt=\"Three Best Rated Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Three-Best-Rated-Logo.jpg 512w, https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Three-Best-Rated-Logo-300x300.jpg 300w, https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Three-Best-Rated-Logo-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bde-image2-1303-172 bde-image2\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/ISHRS-Gold-Member-Logo.jpg\" alt=\"ISHRS Gold Member Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/ISHRS-Gold-Member-Logo.jpg 512w, https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/ISHRS-Gold-Member-Logo-300x300.jpg 300w, https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/ISHRS-Gold-Member-Logo-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"bde-image2-1303-173 bde-image2\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/AHRS-Member-Logo.jpg\" alt=\"AHRS Member Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/AHRS-Member-Logo.jpg 512w, https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/AHRS-Member-Logo-300x300.jpg 300w, https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/AHRS-Member-Logo-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"bde-text-1303-174 bde-text\">\n<b>Click the below button to Book Your Appointment with Dr Sandeep Mahapatra.</b>\n</div><div class=\"bde-button-1303-199 bde-button\">\n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n            \n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-atom button-atom--primary bde-button__button\"  >\n    \n        <span class=\"button-atom__text\">Get Your Free Hair Report</span>\n\n        \n        \n            </button>\n    \n\n\n</div></div>\n</section><section class=\"bde-section-1303-176 bde-section\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"section-container\"><h2 class=\"bde-heading-1303-177 bde-heading\">\nClient Testimonials\n</h2><div class=\"bde-text-1303-178 bde-text\">\nRestore your hair with cutting-edge hair transplant techniques performed by Dr. Sandeep Mahapatra, a renowned Hair Transplant Surgeon. Achieve natural-looking, permanent results with the latest innovations in hair restoration.\n</div><div class=\"bde-div-1303-179 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"bde-heading-1303-180 bde-heading\">\nGoogle Reviews & YouTube Review Videos\n</h3><div class=\"bde-grid-1303-181 bde-grid\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-div-1303-182 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-star-rating-1303-183 bde-star-rating\">\n\n\n\n  <div class='bde-star-rating__wrapper'>\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\"  role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-star fa-w-18 fa-2x\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\" class=\"\"></path></svg>\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\"  role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-star fa-w-18 fa-2x\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\" class=\"\"></path></svg>\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\"  role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-star fa-w-18 fa-2x\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\" class=\"\"></path></svg>\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\"  role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-star fa-w-18 fa-2x\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\" class=\"\"></path></svg>\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\"  role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-star fa-w-18 fa-2x\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\" class=\"\"></path></svg>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n<svg width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n<linearGradient id=\"starhalf183\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"100%\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"0\">\n        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#FFB906FF\"></stop>\n \t\t<stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"lightgrey\"></stop>\n</linearGradient>\n</svg>\n\n</div><p class=\"bde-text-1303-184 bde-text\">\nI did my hair transplant on 6th of June. I have glad to share my experience, so, before hair transplant I had lots of confusion wheather I am going to do or not because lots of rumours in your surrounding.<br><br>Then I planned to visit neo follicles and I met Dr Sandeep Mahapatra, trust me I cleared all my doubts and fixed the date for hair transplant.<br><br>The procedure was going very smoothly and the staffs were very kind and polite . I didn't feel any pain during the procedure.They explained me proper steps pre and post HT.<br><br>It's been almost 1 month and m very satisfied with the process and hope for the best result in future😀🤞<br><br>Specially thanks to all the staffs, Ms Chandra and Sandeep Sir for their work.👍\n</p><div class=\"bde-div-1303-185 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-image-1303-186 bde-image\">\n<figure class=\"breakdance-image breakdance-image--371\">\n\t<div class=\"breakdance-image-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"breakdance-image-clip\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Suvam-Nayak.png\" width=\"54\" height=\"54\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 54px) 100vw, 54px\" alt=\"Testimonials Suvam Nayak from Google Review\"></div>\n\t</div></figure>\n\n</div><div class=\"bde-div-1303-187 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<h6 class=\"bde-heading-1303-188 bde-heading\">\nSuvam Nayak\n</h6>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"bde-div-1303-189 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-star-rating-1303-190 bde-star-rating\">\n\n\n\n  <div class='bde-star-rating__wrapper'>\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\"  role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-star fa-w-18 fa-2x\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\" class=\"\"></path></svg>\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\"  role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-star fa-w-18 fa-2x\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\" class=\"\"></path></svg>\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\"  role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-star fa-w-18 fa-2x\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\" class=\"\"></path></svg>\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\"  role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-star fa-w-18 fa-2x\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\" class=\"\"></path></svg>\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-prefix=\"fas\"  role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-star fa-w-18 fa-2x\"><path d=\"M259.3 17.8L194 150.2 47.9 171.5c-26.2 3.8-36.7 36.1-17.7 54.6l105.7 103-25 145.5c-4.5 26.3 23.2 46 46.4 33.7L288 439.6l130.7 68.7c23.2 12.2 50.9-7.4 46.4-33.7l-25-145.5 105.7-103c19-18.5 8.5-50.8-17.7-54.6L382 150.2 316.7 17.8c-11.7-23.6-45.6-23.9-57.4 0z\" class=\"\"></path></svg>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n<svg width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n<linearGradient id=\"starhalf190\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"100%\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"0\">\n        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#FFB906FF\"></stop>\n \t\t<stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"lightgrey\"></stop>\n</linearGradient>\n</svg>\n\n</div><p class=\"bde-text-1303-191 bde-text\">\nI live in Europe but did a bit of research before homing in on getting my FUE done in India(not getting into the nitty gritty of why but there was a reason).<br><br>I enquired with 4 centres and eventually decided to go with Neo Follicle clinic. Reason was simple, I found the replies that I got from Chandra, clear, straightforward and correct.<br><br>At no point I felt that things are being sold to me. The cost for 4000 grafts was also reasonable quite frankly. I also spoke with Dr. Sandeep and got answers to all the queries. In fact, because there is a long travel involved, I was suggested to stay in Bangalore for 5 days so that if in case some assistance is required, it can be given.<br><br>On the D - day, the procedure started on time and all the staff was very courteous and positive. For cleanliness freaks like me, the clinic and the OT were spick and span.<br><br>Would like to give my sincere thanks to Dr Sandeep, Chandra, Navneet, Pooja and Manju for making this journey smooth.<br><br>Its been 1 month since then and I’m following every thing post procedure by the book. Hoping for positive results. Fingers crossed.\n</p><div class=\"bde-div-1303-192 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bde-image-1303-193 bde-image\">\n<figure class=\"breakdance-image breakdance-image--373\">\n\t<div class=\"breakdance-image-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"breakdance-image-clip\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"breakdance-image-object\" src=\"https://neofollicletransplant.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Abhay-Choudhary.png\" width=\"54\" height=\"54\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 54px) 100vw, 54px\"></div>\n\t</div></figure>\n\n</div><div class=\"bde-div-1303-194 bde-div\">\n  \n  \n\t\n\n\n\n<h6 class=\"bde-heading-1303-195 bde-heading\">\nAbhay Chaudhary\n</h6>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"bde-video-1303-196 bde-video\">\n<di